From 5cfdda27513fa47996e9d76b1246ccb2bbcbf269 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bertholomus <311723197+bertholomus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:21:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(dsv41): each node's weight file and token map from
 the checkpoint; the kit's packer and generators

tf-dsv41-rank-cache writes one rank's weight file (the lane's rank cache) from the EXL3 checkpoint alone, no GPU and no
Python: plan.wants' entries in the loader's order, each sliced by checkpoint.readFrom from its source tensor read whole,
then the index as weights.py writes it (rank_cache.writeRow). --parity takes the four-node balanced experts split;
--index-only prints the index. tf-dsv41-check gains --parity.

tools/dsv41-zig/inputs/node_inputs.sh makes one node's inputs, the weight file and the token map, in one command.
tools/dsv41-zig/kit/ packs a lane's kit with MANIFEST and SHA256SUMS (pack_kit.py), makes its RoPE tables and image
bias (make_rope.py, make_bias_vl.py) and checks it (verify_kit.sh).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
